<title>INDIA: Lehman sees profit growth at India's VSNL.</title>
<headline>Lehman sees profit growth at India's VSNL.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bank Lehman Brothers said on Monday that it expects Indian telecommunications firm Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd (VSNL) to post average annual profit growth of 25 percent over the next five years.</p>
</text>
